„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙhWhat fruit had ye then in those things whereof ye are now ashamed? for the end of those things is death.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ}But now being made free from sin, and become servants to God, ye have your fruit unto holiness, and the end everlasting life.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙaFor the wages of sin is death; but the gift of God is eternal life through Jesus Christ our Lord.¦layout ªlast_verse